### 💡 **Benefit Explanation**

* Enables **real-time monitoring** of Storefront health and performance
* Reduces Mean Time To Detect (MTTD) by leveraging **predefined alerts**
* Provides **data-driven visibility** to engineering and operations
* Eliminates manual checks through automated dashboards and logs
* Aligns Storefront with enterprise-wide monitoring standards

